        <updated>2025-07-11T16:54:23.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179191?u=8dd92441fba3cb438759ee98862670ba56f2c67d&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto">This PR updates and corrects version values for all browsers for the <code class="notranslate">text-orientation</code> CSS property. The data comes from manual testing, running test code through BrowserStack, SauceLabs, custom VMs and/or locally.</p>
<p dir="auto">Test Code:</p>
<div class="snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content="
(Using bcd.testCSSProperty() from the collector)
